      "message": "I believe it would be cleaner to:\n- Upload the revert of the AI Code Review REST-API introduction on the change details backend\n- Introduce the AI support for supporting the action enablement on the frontend and verify that it works by always showing it\n- Introduce the AI enablement support on the backend and verify that the AI feature can be hidden when adding a DENY or BLOCK ACE.\n\nBy mixing the three of them, the review becomes harder IMHO.",
