      "writtenOn": "2026-05-06T18:21:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given that the frontend already renders the button by default when the permission is neither blocked nor denied (i.e. even without any explicit configuration), I don’t think we need the additional complexity of another experimental feature gate (`UiFeature__enable_ai_chat`).\n\nThe permission is still respected when explicitly denied or blocked, so the experiment flag doesn’t add much value here.\n\nThis follow-up change (see change 579641) removes the flag and makes the behavior explicit by always emitting the action.",
